  <p>
    Netlify Forms was a great default while the pricing was predictable.
    The credit-based model made it less so, and a dedicated form backend
    is now usually the simpler answer. Migration is an afternoon's work:
    export, swap the action URL, test, ship. The alternatives above all
    do the job; the right one depends on what you value past "it works."
  </p>
